# limits.defaults - defaults of the limits of the rack IOC, in autosave's file format.
#
# Restored at every IOC start, before the file that autosave writes at run time
# ($MIST2_SAVE/iocRack/limits.sav), whose values win. So these values apply at the first start and
# whenever the saved file is missing; a limit changed from the GUI is kept in the saved file.
# One line per PV: <PV name> <value>, in the unit of the PV.
#
# OWNER: these are the full scales of the supplies, not limits for operation. Put the real limits
# here (or set them from the GUI, which saves them).
AU-20P15-1:current:limit 15
AU-20P7-2:current:limit 7.5
AU-20P7-3:current:limit 7.5
AU-20P7-4:current:limit 7.5
<END>
